    "title": "What Time Does 'Daredevil' Season 2 Come Out on Disney+?",
    "text": "Published March 23, 2026, 2:00 p.m. ET Daredevil Born Again S2- Trailer0 seconds of 1 minute, 18 secondsVolume 0% The never-ending feud between Wilson Fisk and Hell’s Kitchen’s favorite vigilante continues in Season 2 of Daredevil: Born Again. Honestly, it’s been way too long without a new episode of Daredevil. The first season of Born Again concluded almost a year ago (April 15 if we’re being exact), with Mayor Fisk (Vincent D’Onofrio) declaring martial law and outlawing vigilantism, while Daredevil quietly assembles his own army to take down his increasingly dangerous nemesis. The new season, per Disney, will center on Matt Murdock fighting back from the shadows as he tries to tear down the Kingpin’s corrupt empire and save his city. Adding to all the intrigue is the debut of Matthew Lillard as Mr. Charles and Krysten Ritter reprising her role as Jessica Jones. When exactly does the new season of Daredevil: Born Again premiere on Disney+? Here’s everything you need to know. When Is The Daredevil: Born Again Season 2 Release Date? All the action begins Tuesday, March 24 on Disney+! What Time Does Daredevil Season 2 Come Out On Disney+? The new season of Daredevil: Born Again premieres Tuesday, March 24 at 9:01 p.m. ET on Disney+. One episode drops on March 24, with new episodes premiering Tuesday nights on Disney+. Daredevil: Born Again Season 2 Release Schedule: The second season of Daredevil: Born Again consists of eight episodes, with the season finale scheduled to debut Tuesday, May 5 at 9:01 p.m. ET on Disney+. Episodes 2 and 3: Tuesday, March 31 Episode 4: Tuesday, April 7 Episode 5: Tuesday, April 14 Episode 6: Tuesday, April 21 Episode 7: Tuesday, April 28 Episode 8: Tuesday, May 5 Where To Watch Daredevil: Born Again Season 2: From now until Tuesday, March 24 at 8:59 a.m. PDT, you can bundle Hulu and Disney+ for only $4.99/month for three months. Disney+ offers a number of subscription options, so you can find the one that works for you. With ads, a subscription costs $10.99/month; without ads, it’s $18.99/month or $189.99/year. There are also Disney+ bundles with Hulu, HBO Max, and ESPN+, so you can subscribe to up to three services at once and save over 40% every month. The bundles are available in a few different configurations, starting at $12.99/month for Disney+ and Hulu with ads, and going up to $32.99/month for Disney+, Hulu, and Max ad-free. Season 2 of Daredevil: Born Again premieres Tuesday, March 24 at 9:01 p.m. ET on Disney+. Tags Charlie Cox Daredevil: Born Again Disney+",
